# rows-lit-hk-drag (H7): a held shift-handle drag (x2, h=1, k=-2, scale 0.5:
# diamond at plot (1,-2) = page (978,590)) lights the h and k rows with both
# rulers out and their marks sliding at the live values; a and b stay dark.
# Pressed 2 px off-centre and moved +40,-32 px, as the reference probe does.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&h=1&k=-2&scale=0.5
wait 500
move 980 592
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1020 558 over 160
wait 300
shot rows-lit-hk-drag
up
